Subject: [PATCH 1/5] vendor: opencode wire alignment (UA, TLS, ids)

Lock the opencode UA across the netclient and openai provider, pass TLS
options through tls.connect via undici connect top-level, and align the
opencode simulation contracts with the wire spec (tests included).
